ps://api.github.com/users/microsoft/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/microsoft/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg","description":"C++ Library Manager for Windows, Linux, and MacOS","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/teams","hooks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/hooks","issue_events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/events{/number}","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/events","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/assignees{/user}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/branches{/branch}","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/tags","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/deployments","created_at":"2016-09-15T16:40:50Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T05:34:58Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T03:27:24Z","git_url":"git://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:microsoft/vcpkg.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg","homepage":"","size":96040,"stargazers_count":26254,"watchers_count":26254,"language":"CMake","has_issues":true,"has_projects":false,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":7235,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1320,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["c","cmake","cplusplus","cpp","libraries","package-manager","packages","vcpkg","visual-studio","windows"],"visibility":"public","forks":7235,"open_issues":1320,"watchers":26254,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/pulls/11228","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/pull/11228","diff_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/pull/11228.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/pull/11228.patch","merged_at":"2020-05-08T21:48:03Z"},"body":"**Describe the pull request**\r\nThis PR fixes and issue for protobuf when building for Android. \r\nWhen linking, an error \"undefined reference to '__android_log_write' was happening.\r\n\r\nThe original error is likely inside protobuf CMakeLists, which should link the log library under Android: see [this issue in protobuf repo](https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/issues/2719)\r\n\r\n**This fixes https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/8218**\r\n\r\n- Which triplets are supported/not supported? \r\nThere is no official Android triplet at the moment. I will add an example triplet below. \r\n\r\n- Have you updated the CI baseline?\r\nNo\r\n\r\n- Does your PR follow the [maintainer guide](https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/blob/master/docs/maintainers/maintainer-guide.md)?\r\nYes\r\n\r\n---- \r\n\r\nThere is no official android triplet file. So, I provide an example one below. May be it could be an inspiration for a triplet in the community folder (however I am *not* an android expert).\r\n\r\n**Steps to reproduce the build**\r\n\r\n1. Use this triplet file:\r\n\r\n`triplets/android-armeabi-v7a.cmake`\r\n````cmake\r\nset(VCPKG_TARGET_ARCHITECTURE arm)\r\nset(VCPKG_CRT_LINKAGE static)\r\nset(VCPKG_LIBRARY_LINKAGE dynamic)\r\nset(VCPKG_CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME Android)\r\n\r\nset(ANDROID_NDK_HOME $ENV{ANDROID_NDK_HOME})\r\nif (\"${ANDROID_NDK_HOME}\" MATCHES \"^$\")\r\n  message(FATAL_ERROR \r\n    \"Please set an env variable ANDROID_NDK_HOME pointing to your ndk-bundle folder. \r\n    For example: export ANDROID_NDK_HOME=/home/your-account/Android/Sdk/ndk-bundle\")\r\nendif()\r\nset(VCPKG_CHAINLOAD_TOOLCHAIN_FILE ${ANDROID_NDK_HOME}/build/cmake/android.toolchain.cmake)\r\n\r\nset(ANDROID_ABI armeabi-v7a)\r\n# ANDROID_ABI can be : \"armeabi-v7a\" , \"armeabi-v7a with NEON\", \"arm64-v8a\", \"x86\" or \"x86_64\"\r\n````\r\n\r\n2. Download and install the [android ndk-bundle](https://developer.android.com/ndk/downloads/)\r\n\r\n3. Set an env var to the ndk-bundle folder\r\n````\r\n    export ANDROID_NDK_HOME=/home/your-account/Android/Sdk/ndk-bundle\r\n````\r\n\r\n4. Build the protobuf package\r\n````\r\n    ./vcpkg install \"protobuf:android-armeabi-v7a\"\r\n````\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/11228/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/11228/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":3314431096,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDMzMTQ0MzEwOTY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/events/3314431096","actor":{"login":"pthom","id":7694091,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTQwOTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7694091?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pthom","html_url":"https://github.com/pthom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pthom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pthom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pthom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pthom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pthom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pthom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/us